Subject: [PATCH] [M156] views: FOR_DROP menu teardown UAF as merged to 8078
 (66ed8d17e9)

Bring ui/views/controls/menu to the M156 branch state of 66ed8d17e9
(crbug 565066840, merge 588203706). FlyWeb carried the M159 merges
041491e936 (crrev 8613791) and afa45b8e16 since 3.2.1; M156 reverted
8613791 (b0cd918806, b/576555601) and its own merge of the FOR_DROP fix
keeps `controller_` across MenuRunnerImpl::OnMenuClosed only for
FOR_DROP menus. Net change against our tree: OnMenuClosed clears
`controller_` again for non-FOR_DROP menus (e.g. AppMenu), and
menu_runner_unittest.cc takes the M156 tests. menu_controller.cc is
unchanged: our version already holds the same fix.
---
 ui/views/controls/menu/menu_runner_impl.cc    |   5 +-
 .../controls/menu/menu_runner_unittest.cc     | 117 ++++++++----------
 2 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 68 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ui/views/controls/menu/menu_runner_impl.cc b/ui/views/controls/menu/menu_runner_impl.cc
index 60e9c432c16022410f2a86a127b16c25df37e8aa..57691e3ab71ec34ae97a17864d43abf480c9f244 100644
--- a/ui/views/controls/menu/menu_runner_impl.cc
+++ b/ui/views/controls/menu/menu_runner_impl.cc
@@ -112,7 +112,7 @@ void MenuRunnerImpl::Release() {
 
   bool is_stack_active = controller_ && controller_->IsStackActive();
   if (is_stack_active) {
-    // Invlidate the menu runner's weakptrs now because the menu runner is
+    // Invalidate the menu runner's weakptrs now because the menu runner is
     // considered deleted at this point.
     weak_factory_.InvalidateWeakPtrs();
     // Transfer ownership to controller.
@@ -266,6 +266,9 @@ void MenuRunnerImpl::OnMenuClosed(NotifyType type,
     return;
   }
   running_ = false;
+  if (!for_drop_) {
+    controller_ = nullptr;
+  }
   if (menu_->GetDelegate()) {
     // Executing the command may also delete this.
     base::WeakPtr<MenuRunnerImpl> ref(weak_factory_.GetWeakPtr());
